{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The E-flite UMX (Ultra Micro eXtreme) Cirrus SR22T is an officially licensed replica of the world's best-selling personal aircraft. This elegant masterpiece arrives fully factory-assembled and is ready to take to the air just about anywhere \u2013 from large yards and small parks to sports fields and beyond! It's an updated and upgraded version of the original UMX Cirrus equipped with a quieter and more powerful motor compatible with popular and affordable 2S and 3S 280\u2013300mAh batteries. It's also equipped with expertly-tuned AS3X and optional-use SAFE Select technologies for easy, smooth flight. Clear windows and cockpit detail, functional LED navigation lights, and a premium, fully-painted finish offer an unmatched ultra-micro Cirrus experience you simply can't get with any other model!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3482970?t=1743033815","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3482970?t=1743033815","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482970/cfa9e0003831eef42dd0a6a14aa9017c67abf0e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743033815","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482970/cfa9e0003831eef42dd0a6a14aa9017c67abf0e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743033815","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The E-flite UMX (U